-- Thebes · Wordle on an analog media player. One portrait panel for the feed: a walnut cabinet, a brushed faceplate,
-- a speaker grille, the brand on a gold badge, a smoked VFD screen the board glows on, a sunk key deck, a light dial
-- and a power switch. The skin is ordinary godtongue; the last block puts the game on it.
-- Build: node bin/gt.js build examples/games/diner-deck.gt --engine game

-- what changes from one challenge to the next
Let the word be "toast".
Let the tries be 6.
Let ink be #ffb347.
Let walnut be #5a3620.

Let there be a canvas called diner-deck, 1080 by 1920, from aluminium.
Let text be in Jost, size 26.

-- the cabinet and its faceplate
Let there be a rectangle called cabinet, 1040 by 1880, corners 70, at 540 960.
Make the cabinet a gradient from #6e4428 to #24140a, angled 90.
Give the cabinet an inner shadow, 10 down, blur 24, 50% opacity.
Let there be a rectangle called face, 960 by 1790, corners 44, at 540 960.
Make the face a gradient from #e6e8eb to #a9aeb5, angled 90.
Give the face an outline in #7d838b, 3 wide.
Give the face an inner shadow, 3 down, blur 6, in #ffffff, 60% opacity.

-- speaker grille
Let there be 90 circles called hole, 8 big, in a grid 18 by 5, 46 apart, from 149 120.
Make the holes #2a2724.
Give the holes an inner shadow, 2 down, blur 3, 80% opacity.

-- the brand
Let there be a rectangle called badge, 680 by 120, corners 18, at 540 400.
Make the badge gold.
Emboss the badge, 0.2 mm high, soft 0.6.
Write "MAMA'S DINER" called brand in Big Shoulders Display bold, size 76, tracking 6, in the badge.
Make the brand #3b2410.
Write "THE DAILY WORD  ·  No. 001" called tagline in Martian Mono, size 22, tracking 4, under the badge, 22 apart.
Make the tagline #4a4e55.

-- the screen: smoked glass, where the board glows
Let there be a rectangle called screen, 860 by 820, corners 26, at 540 950.
Make the screen a gradient from #1d1a16 to #0b0a08, angled 90.
Give the screen an inner shadow, 8 down, blur 22, 80% opacity.
Give the screen an outline in #3a352e, 6 wide.

-- the key deck
Let there be a rectangle called deck, 900 by 330, corners 22, at 540 1530.
Make the deck #2b2723.
Give the deck an inner shadow, 6 down, blur 14, 70% opacity.

-- light dial and power switch
Let there be a circle called dial, 58 big, at 230 1778.
Make the dial mirror chrome.
Emboss the dial, 0.35 mm high, soft 0.5.
Write "LIGHT" called dial-label in Martian Mono, size 22, tracking 4, beside the dial, 26 apart.
Make the dial-label #4a4e55.
Let there be a circle called switch, 38 big, at 850 1778.
Make the switch #1d1a16.
Emboss the switch, 0.25 mm high, soft 0.5.
Write "POWER" called switch-label in Martian Mono, size 22, tracking 4, left of the switch, 26 apart.
Make the switch-label #4a4e55.

-- the game
Play wordle on the screen, with the keyboard on the deck.
Every tile is #15130f, with ink letters, in Martian Mono, glowing, sunk, corners 6.
A typed tile is #1f1b15.
A correct tile is #1f6b4f, with #b8ffd9 letters.
A present tile is #8a6418, with #ffe2a8 letters.
An absent tile is #24211d, with #6e675c letters.
Every key is ivory, with #2b2118 letters, in Jost, raised, corners 10.
A correct key is #2f8f6b, with white letters.
A present key is #d9a441, with #2b2118 letters.
An absent key is #5a554d, with #d8d2c6 letters.
Control the light with the dial.
Control the power with the switch.
When the game is won, say "Lunch is on us. Show this at the counter.".
When the game is lost, say "So close. Come back tomorrow.".
